<title>FRANCE: EU maintains refund on wheat flour export - official.</title>
<headline>EU maintains refund on wheat flour export - official.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday kept the daily refund on exports of soft wheat flour unchanged at 22 Ecus per tonne, EU grain officials said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
